# Patched Plaything, "Double strike. This creature enters with two -1/-1 counters on it if you cast it from your hand." Cast from
# Bot1's hand on turn 1 it enters as a 2/1 (4/3 with two -1/-1 counters, CR 614.1c), and attacking Bot2 on turn 3 its double strike
# (CR 702.4) deals 2 first-strike damage and 2 regular damage: Bot2 goes from 20 to 16.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Patched Plaything
Island x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
